# shadcn/ui Usage Guidelines

This project uses **shadcn/ui** for all UI elements and components.

## Setup Commands

### Initialize shadcn/ui (if not already done)
If shadcn/ui is not initialized in the project, use:
```bash
npx shadcn@latest init
```

### Install Components
If a particular component is not installed, use the following command format:
```bash
npx shadcn@latest add [component-name]
```

**Example:** To install the button component:
```bash
npx shadcn@latest add button
```

## Component Usage
- Always use shadcn/ui components for UI elements
- Import components from `@/components/ui/[component-name]`
- Follow shadcn/ui conventions and patterns
- Prefer shadcn/ui components over custom implementations

## Available Components
Common shadcn/ui components include: button, input, card, dialog, dropdown-menu, form, label, select, textarea, toast, and many others.

Check the [shadcn/ui documentation](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components) for the full list of available components.